DRVFuzz-compatible --dump-commit-trace for OpenXiangShan/difftest.

DRVFuzz (DRVFuzz/src/impls/xiangshan/execute.rs) parses the emu commit trace and
needs two things that upstream difftest does not print:
  1. the register file of the destination: "dst x08" / "dst f03" / "dst v01"
     instead of "dst 08";
  2. the DUT memory writes: one "mem pc <pc> addr <addr> data <data> mask 0x<mask>"
     line per 8-byte word written, printed when the store event reaches difftest
     (StoreRecorder), only while the commit trace is enabled.
Nothing else changes: the checks against the REF model are untouched.

Made against difftest ecdf41e225a93699b9a1141ec4d0fc1ff485b890 (the submodule
commit of XiangShan kunminghu-v3 182b2277c0e4115e39ae396f7d705bc4e20e0def);
also applies to difftest 56a632a97abfec5c785c2a9ff70253f84b147625.
Apply inside XiangShan/difftest:  git apply difftest-drvfuzz-commit-trace.patch

